{"id":402750,"shortDescription":"Toma control de las siete máquinas industriales más grandes del mundo. Durante una campaña (14 misiones) traspasarás por las nieves de Groenlandia, pequisarás los parajes de Wyoming y llegarás hasta Florida soleada. Terminarás tu duro trabajo en construcción enviando el transbordador espacial en el espacio.","developers":["Code Horizon"],"publishers":["Code Horizon","PlayWay S.A."],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Cromos de Steam","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"29 SEP 2016","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/402750/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1794222251","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/402750/ss_f7d8a635ebfbec474447574e49b0e634638d6f06.600x338.jpg?t=1794222251","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/402750/ss_f7d8a635ebfbec474447574e49b0e634638d6f06.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794222251"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/402750/ss_82bbb07f03a3270990cd26da787d1ba927c0041f.600x338.jpg?t=1794222251","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/402750/ss_82bbb07f03a3270990cd26da787d1ba927c0041f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794222251"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/402750/ss_fa303d95cbe6d87c5f74f9ff724ed0a0b87a9271.600x338.jpg?t=1794222251","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/402750/ss_fa303d95cbe6d87c5f74f9ff724ed0a0b87a9271.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794222251"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/402750/ss_69f67caccb62ec554d7632a74cb5048adff3e0a0.600x338.jpg?t=1794222251","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/402750/ss_69f67caccb62ec554d7632a74cb5048adff3e0a0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794222251"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item